&lt;p&gt;The Senior Product Manager, Clinical Finance is a clinical-finance subject matter expert and product leader who creates meaningful value for sponsors, CROs, and sites. Working closely with the Associate Vice President, Product Management, this role helps set product strategy and roadmap direction across Suvoda’s&amp;nbsp;Greenphire&amp;nbsp;Clinical Finance suite, with primary focus on Budgeting &amp;amp; Benchmarking and Site Payments.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role brings together clinical pricing, investigator grant budgeting,&amp;nbsp;fair market value&amp;nbsp;benchmarking, sponsor/site negotiation, and payment execution. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will use direct sponsor-side experience to identify customer needs, shape product priorities, and provide initiative-level direction that helps Product Owners and delivery teams design effective software. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate brings deep sponsor-side clinical-finance expertise, hands-on experience implementing technology, and strong software product management experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Deep industry knowledge is the higher-priority qualification; candidates with less formal product-management experience may be successful with mentorship if they demonstrate sound product judgment, stakeholder leadership, and the ability to translate operational needs into technology solutions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Senior Product Manager manages and develops Product Owners and partners closely with them throughout discovery and delivery, ensuring they have the customer context, desired outcomes, priorities, and decision support needed to shape effective initiatives and epics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Partner with the Associate Vice President, Product Management, to set and communicate product vision, strategy, roadmap, and priorities for assigned&amp;nbsp;Greenphire&amp;nbsp;Clinical Finance products and capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Apply practical knowledge of sponsor-side clinical pricing, budgeting, benchmarking, site contracting, and payment operations to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;high-value opportunities and shape an integrated experience from study planning through payment execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Engage sponsors, CROs, sites, commercial teams, and internal subject matter experts to understand workflow challenges,&amp;nbsp;validatecustomer needs, and define meaningful product outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Lead initiative-level discovery by translating customer, business, operational, and market needs into problem statements, desired outcomes, scope boundaries, success measures, dependencies, and prioritized roadmap decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Manage, coach, and develop Product Owners through clear expectations, goal setting, workload planning, performance feedback, career development, and consistent product practices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Partner closely with Product Owners as they shape initiatives and epics, providing customer and market context, roadmap rationale, decision support,&amp;nbsp;timelyanswers, ambiguity resolution, and facilitation of sound trade-off decisions with internal and external stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Recommend product investments to executive leadership using customer evidence, market analysis, business cases, and return-on-investment considerations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Collaborate with Product Owners, Engineering, UX, Architecture, Quality, Professional Services, Support, Commercial, Sales, and Marketing to deliver reliable, usable, and scalable software, prepare enhancements for successful launch, and drive effective sales enablement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Participate actively throughout the software development life cycle, from discovery and solution definition through delivery, validation, release, adoption, and continuous improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Establish success measures and use product data, customer feedback, and operational insight to evaluate outcomes and refine priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Support customer conversations, demonstrations, implementations, sales opportunities, competitive analysis, and thought leadership as needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
