&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Direct experience with clinical trial sponsor budgeting, clinical pricing, investigator grant budgets, budget negotiation, benchmarking, site payment operations, or closely related clinical finance processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; Demonstrated experience implementing, configuring, launching, or operationalizing technology within a pharmaceutical sponsor, biotechnology sponsor, CRO, clinical-trial, or related operational environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
