&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Commercial Compliance - Finance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity where we are looking for a Commercial Compliance Director to become part of the&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;UK Commercial Compliance team, reporting to the Commercial Compliance VP. This is a key role, with an overriding objective to partner with the Chief Commercial Finance Officer, Commercial Compliance VP, and other Senior Commercial and Compliance stakeholders to ensure that the agency is complying with all aspects of its contractual commitments whilst fostering a growth mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This includes working with the Commercial team to ensure that contractual provisions in terms of charging mechanisms and notifications to clients are managed accurately and in a timely manner, whilst always having an eye on the Commercial growth and profitability of WPP Media UK.&amp;nbsp; The other key aspect of the role is to ensure that systems, controls, and processes are robust, standardised, and applied to eliminate any risk of revenue loss.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co management of agency client audit program with specific responsibility for a portfolio of key clients. To include:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination of the markets/auditors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiation of scopes of audit, NDAs and MRLs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit briefings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintenance of the annual agency client certification program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiation of post audit settlement/makegoods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementation of post audit remedial plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking of results and correction of any noncompliance issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising with third party audit firms, and ensuring that information required is supplied in the correct format and on a timely basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsibility for all client notifications and declarations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the commercial team to apply the correct interpretation of&amp;nbsp;WPP’s contractual commitments and reporting thereof, including liaison with affiliate entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Link between the commercial team and finance in ensuring that commercial terms are correctly applied in terms of charging methodology across all income types.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the Commercial Compliance VP in ensuring that new commercial models are compliant and have the required level of governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ad hoc commercial analysis for the Commercial Compliance VP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To work with the UK, EMEA and Global commercial teams to maintain the compliance schedule and ensure that it is up to date and that changes are communicated to the relevant account teams immediately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To review the existing control processes and suggest improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the Commercial Team, responsible for onboarding new clients/contracts, communicating key commercial compliance and operational terms, assessing commercial risk and implementing counter measures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner in the development of training and best practice programs to include commercial contractual knowledge and deploy into business providing training where necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the maintenance of up-to-date agency commercial guidance documentation and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate to the agency/to appropriate personnel any new financial and commercial group policies and ensure these are being implemented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on engagement in any agency commercial/contractual projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a small-sized team of supervisors, professionals, and/or analysts, fostering a collaborative and high-performing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing coaching, training, and development opportunities to enhance team skills and contribute to their professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be &lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt; environment by&lt;em&gt; Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead &lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt; by &lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified accountant/auditor or someone holding a legal qualification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry Commercial / Compliance / Financial experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of core agency concepts – agency benefits, disclosed buying models, undisclosed inventory, vendor contracts &amp;amp; remuneration models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capacity for multi-tasking and meeting multiple simultaneous deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High levels of gravitas with strong interpersonal skills, ability to communicate well, build trust and engender strong relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially astute:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of unravelling commercial contracts and interpreting them for Commercial Compliance purposes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An innate ability to navigate the “grey” and negotiate commercial situations/contracts to the benefit of the agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates good commercial logic and reasoning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and attention to detail:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logical, concise and proficient at breaking down challenges into component parts and developing solutions-based responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forward thinking and a detailed planner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural attention to detail and ability to digest information from a wide variety of sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open-minded, adept at developing/ assessing different options and solutions and adopting a helicopter view when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience of Financial/audit best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge and skills within commercial management, with an understanding of the impact of this work on other areas of the organisation (e.g., Finance, Legal, Client Leadership).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in managing client compliance audit negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills with the ability to prioritise tasks and meet deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage and develop a team, providing clear instruction and constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive approach, a logical and analytical thought process, with good attention to detail and high level of accuracy in their output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation skills and the ability to problem solve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work under pressure and to tight timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly proficient with Excel (Advanced excel skills)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the single threaded owner for all first and last mile activities in France, your mission is to drive quality and cost improvement for your market, which you will deliver on through strong supplier management, relentless focus on driving key metrics, influencing stakeholders and being an inspirational leader for your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the day to day delivery operations for all of France and have a team of delivery managers and coordinators to support you in your mission. You will spend your time ensuring that our DSP’s are meeting service obligations whilst future proofing your operation so that we are able to support the ambitious growth plans for VintedGo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;ol1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reduce FM / LM cost per parcel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;The budget holder for your market, responsible for keeping costs under control and identifying / implementing savings through strategic negotiations or other efficiency opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Whilst the mission is to reduce cost, there must be a cognisance of the impact on speed and own any trade off’s that need to be made&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Responsible for improving customer experience by making sure that parcels as passing through each stage of the funnel without delay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Day to day driving of DSP performance through the delivery team. Ensure that team is focussed on the most impactful topics through data analysis and clear action planning to improve funnel speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Ensure that we are visiting the correct amount of points on a weekly basis and the split between the points is balanced to ensure parcels are not dwelling needlessly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: Building strong relationships with key stakeholders to ensure that:&lt;br&gt;transportation topics are being prioritised, we are supporting the wider business where needed, we have clear handshakes between functions and we are taking decisions that provide the biggest net benefit to the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team motivation and happiness: &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure that the delivery team is clear on the departmental objectives and motivated to go above and beyond to achieve our goals. The team should feel supported and empowered to drive meaningful business improvement&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logistics and transportation expertise&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen for P&amp;amp;L ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced problem solver within logistics and transportation businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical knowledges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record building and executing operational improvement plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the subtleties and nuances in French transportation networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in French transport regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience working with French DSP’s providing last mile services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly numerate with strong data analysis skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Natural communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Ability to navigate into a multicultural environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 working days of holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Medical Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€85.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€95.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Manager of Public Sector Solutions Architects, you will lead a team of Solutions Architects serving public sector customers. This role sits at the intersection of technical strategy, customer outcomes, and team leadership. You will support high-impact public sector opportunities, guide technical pre-sales work from planning through monitoring, and help your team connect GitLab’s DevSecOps platform to each customer’s business and mission needs. In your first year, you will be expected to strengthen team execution, improve how the team works across functions, and coach Solutions Architects to deliver consistent technical leadership across strategic engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report through the sales organization and work closely with regional sales managers, as well as peers in Engineering, Product Management, and Marketing. This is a hands-on leadership opportunity where you will both grow a high-performing team and lead by example in customer-facing solution architecture work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to customer requirements, you must be a United States Citizen (defined as any individual who is a citizen of the United States by law, birth, or naturalization) to fill this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple high-impact initiatives that support strategic public sector sales opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of Solutions Architects through hiring, coaching, feedback, and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide technical evaluations and validation efforts to help customers understand how GitLab meets their business and technical requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with regional sales managers on account strategy and with cross-functional leaders on complex opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve team practices and execution strategies in partnership with Solutions Architect leadership and other departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate GitLab’s vision, strategy, and values in a way that helps your team apply them in day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track team execution through key performance indicators and provide clear updates to peers and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model strong customer engagement by acting as a Solutions Architect on selected opportunities to support customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 3-5 years experience in Public Sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership: 2+ years of experience leading high-performing teams, ideally in a global or remote environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams with accountability for execution, coaching, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in technical pre-sales or a related information technology role that supports customer-facing solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of modern software development or operations practices across the software delivery lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud computing technologies and the practices that support secure, scalable adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to mentor others and give and receive constructive feedback in a clear, respectful way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with other managers and cross-functional partners to develop and carry out shared strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting public sector customers and understanding the needs of regulated or mission-driven environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness to bringing transferable leadership and technical experience from adjacent fields where customer outcomes, collaboration, and technical credibility are important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Public Sector Solutions Architect team helps customers understand how GitLab can support secure, effective software development from planning to monitoring. As a distributed team, we collaborate asynchronously across regions while aligning on shared practices for strategic customer engagement. We are focused on helping public sector organizations connect technical decisions to business outcomes while improving the consistency and effectiveness of GitLab’s technical pre-sales approach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$183,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$308,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
