&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

Caritas Zagrebačke nadbiskupije zapošljava odgojitelja/icu u Kući za skrb o djeci i odraslim osobama s mentalnim ili tjelesnim oštećenjima, Kuća bl. Alojzija Stepinca u Brezovici. 
Uvjeti: 
-  VŠS/VSS, završen specijalistički diplomski stručni studij ili prijediplomski sveučilišni studij ili preddiplomski i/ili diplomski sveučilišni studij odnosno integrirani preddiplomski i diplomski sveučilišni studij socijalnog rada, socijalne politike, psihologije, socijalne pedagogije, edukacijske rehabilitacije, logopedije, sociologije, filozofije, kineziologije, pedagogije, politologije, fonetike, teologije, ranog i predškolskog odgoja i obrazovanja, radne terapije ili završen drugi odgovarajući studij za rad na radnom mjestu učitelja ili nastavnika 
- 1 godina radnog iskustva 
- položen stručni ispit 
- probni rad u trajanju 3 mjeseca (VŠS) ili 6 mjeseci (VSS) 

Opis radnog mjesta 
• vodi cjelokupnu skrb o korisniku i skupini u kojoj odgaja djecu i mladež  po pravilima struke i etike bez ugroze dobrobiti korisnika, uz razvijanje fizičkog, emocionalnog, psihičkog i socijalnog osjećaja sigurnosti korisnika; 
• potiče korisnika na aktivnosti osobnim angažmanom i primjerom te stimulativnim mjerama razvija interes za; 
• obrazovanje i osposobljavanje korisnika; 
• usvajanje motoričkih i praktično-osobnih vještina (razvoj grube i fine motorike, kultura hranjenja, osobna higijena, osobni izgled i urednost, odijevanje, zdravlje i sigurnost, održavanje stambenog prostora, održavanje odjeće, aktivnosti u kuhinji i blagovaonici); 
• usvajanje spoznajno-društvenih vještina (poznavanje neposredne i bliže okolice, kretanje i putovanje, poznavanje i korištenje usluga raznih ustanova i javnih službi, orijentacija u vremenu, korištenje komunikacijskih vještina, usvajanje praktičnih znanja i njihova primjena, upoznavanje osobina i odnosa među predmetima; 
• razvijanje interesno-kreativnih aktivnosti (interesa za provođenje aktivnosti, poticanje kreativnosti, uključivanje u aktivnosti slobodnog vremena); 
• emocionalni razvoj i usvajanje socijalno vrijednosnog sustava (odnos prema sebi – prepoznavanje, izražavanje i kontrola emocija, spoznaja vlastitih osobina i potreba, odabir ponašanja i prihvaćanje odgovornosti; odnos prema drugima – socijalna interakcija, razvijanje grupnih odnosa, prihvaćanje suradnje i zajedništva, prevladavanje sukoba; odnos prema okolini i društvenim vrijednostima lokalne i šire zajednice – razvijanje pozitivnog stava prema okolini, upoznavanje s kulturnim, tradicionalnim i nacionalnim vrijednostima zajednice, pozitivan i aktivan odnos prema radu i društvenim vrijednostima), kroz trening socijalnih vještina; 
• sudjeluje pri prijemu i otpustu korisnika i upoznavanju s novom sredinom, obvezama i pravima korisnika i pomaže mu pri uključivanju u odgojnu skupinu; 
• pruža stručnu pomoć u učenju, u razvoju i usvajanju navika učenja, tehnika učenja, razvijanju samostalnosti u učenju i odgovornog izvršenja školskih obaveza te nadzire redovitost izvršenja školskih obaveza; 
• uključuje korisnika u širu socijalnu sredinu kroz organizirane aktivnosti (odlazak u kazalište, kino, klubove, na izlete i sl.; 
• radi na razvijanju samopouzdanja i samokontrole te prevenciji rizičnih oblika ponašanja; 
• surađuje sa školama i drugim ustanovama važnim za psihofizički razvoj korisnika; 
• izrađuje i odgovoran je za pravilno vođenje dokumentacije o korisniku prema propisanim protokolima, pravilnicima, naputcima i sudjeluje u radu stručnih tijela Kuće (po potrebi sudjeluje u radu stručnog tima Kuće); 
• provodi evaluaciju programa rada u suradnji s korisnikom, roditeljem/skrbnikom i stručnim timom; 
• radi prema rasporedu u smjenama i uključen je u dežurstva vikendom i praznikom; 
• kontinuirano se stručno usavršava te aktivno i pasivno sudjeluje na stručnim predavanjima, skupovima i edukacijama na području odgojnog rada; 
• poštuje etička pravila i profesionalnost u radu s povjerljivim informacijama; 
• obavlja i druge poslovi po nalogu stručnog voditelja, voditelja Kuće, voditelja Sektora i ravnatelja; 
• za svoj rad odgovara stručnom voditelju, voditelju Kuće, voditelju Sektora i ravnatelju. 
Mjesto rada: Brezovica, Brezovička cesta 98 
Radno vrijeme: u smjenama, rad vikenom i praznikom prema rasoporedu 

Uz pisanu prijavu na natječaj i životopis potrebno je priložiti: 
1. Presliku osobne iskaznice; 
2. Preslika domovnice; 
3. Elektronički zapis o radnopravnom statusu; 
4. Dokaz o stečenoj stručnoj spremi (preslika diplome); 
5. Dokaz o položenom stručnom ispitu (preslika), ako postoji; 
6. Odobrenje za samostalan rad (licenca) od nadležne komore (preslika), ako postoji; 
7. Uvjerenje da se ne vodi kazneni postupak (Zakon o socijalnoj skrbi (NN 18/22 71/23 61/25) članak 261.). 
Natječajna dokumentacija dostavlja se e-mailom na <a href="mailto:prijemni.ured@czn.hr" rel="nofollow">prijemni.ured@czn.hr</a> ili poštom na Caritas Zagrebačke nadbiskupije, Babonićeva 121, 10000 Zagreb

Caritas Zagrebačke nadbiskupije zapošljava medicinsku sestru/medicinskog tehničara / primalju (m/ž) za njegu u Kući Bl. Alojzija Stepinca u Brezovici - skrb za djecu i odrasle s tjelesnim i mentalnim oštećenjem. 
UVJET: 
• SSS, završeno strukovno obrazovanje za zanimanje medicinska sestra ili završeno srednjoškolsko obrazovanje za primalje 
• VŠS, završen sveučilišni ili stručni prijediplomski studij sestrinstva/primaljstva 
• odobrenje za samostalan rad izdano pri nadležnoj komori 
• probni rad u trajanju 2 mjeseca 
• 1 godina radnog iskustva ui struci 

RADNO VRIJEME: 
• rad u smjenama 
• dežurstva vikendom i praznikom prema rasporedu 

Opis radnog mjesta: 
• svakodnevno prati opće zdravstveno stanje korisnika (promatranje i evidentiranje općeg izgleda, funkcionalnosti, promjene ponašanja i drugih pokazatelja zdravstvenih teškoća, mjerenje temperature, pojačano praćenje korisnika pod farmakoterapijom i korisnika u pogoršanom stanju) i izvještava glavnu sestru; 
• dijeli pripremljenu medicinsku terapiju korisnicima; 
• provodi njegu korisnika koja uključuje: pomoć pri obavljanju osobne higijene, pomoć kod oblačenja i svlačenja korisnika, pomoć kod hranjenja korisnika, pomoć pri obavljanju fizioloških potreba korisnika, održavanje higijene posteljine korisnika, održavanje higijene prostora, dezinfekcija pomagala i ostalog upotrijebljenog pribora i instrumenata, provođenje preventivnih mjera za sprečavanje dekubitusa, kontraktura, tromboze i respiratornih komplikacija, uočavanje promjena na korisniku i izvještava glavnu sestru; 
• skrbi tijekom noći o korisnicima te prati ponašanje i navike korisnika, priprema korisnike za spavanje, budi korisnike, nadzire korisnike tijekom noći i provodi potrebne aktivnosti tijekom noći vezane uz njegu i zaštitu zdravlja korisnika; 
• priprema korisnike za liječničke preglede u i izvan Kuće i prati ih na liječnički pregled po potrebi; 
• radi prema rasporedu u smjenama i uključena je u dežurstva vikendom i praznikom; 
• vodi i odgovorna je za pravilno vođenje zdravstvene dokumentacije korisnika sukladno važećim propisima i prema propisanim protokolima, pravilnicima, naputcima i sudjeluje u radu stručnih tijela Kuće; 
• sudjeluje u izradi i provedbi projekata Caritasa; 
• kontinuirano se stručno usavršava i aktivno i pasivno sudjeluje na stručnim predavanjima, skupovima i edukacijama na području sestrinstva; 
• pridržava se mjera zaštite na radu i zaštite od požara; 
• poštuje etička pravila i profesionalnost u radu s povjerljivim informacijama; 
• obavlja i druge poslovi po nalogu voditelja Službe, Kuće i Sektora i ravnatelja; 
• za svoj rad odgovara voditeljima Službe, Kuće i Sektora i ravnatelju. 

Uz pisanu prijavu na natječaj i životopis potrebno je priložiti: 
1. Presliku osobne iskaznice; 
2. Preslika domovnice; 
3. Elektronički zapis o radnopravnom statusu; 
4. Dokaz o stečenoj stručnoj spremi (preslika diplome); 
5. položen stručni ispit za medicinsku sestru/tehničara 
6. Odobrenje za samostalan rad (licenca) od nadležne komore (preslika); 
7. Uvjerenje da se ne vodi kazneni postupak (Zakon o socijalnoj skrbi (NN 18/22 71/23 61/25) članak 261.). 
Dokumentacija se dostavlja e-mailom na <a href="mailto:prijemni.ured@czn.hr" rel="nofollow">prijemni.ured@czn.hr</a> ili poštom na Caritas Zagrebačke nadbiskupije, Ulica Stjepana Babonića 121, 10000 Zagreb. U prijavi je potrebno jasno naznačiti za koje radno mjesto se kandidat/kinja prijavljuje.

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to: Director, Renewals&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a first-line people-management role focused on the day-to-day execution and coaching of individual contributors — typically early-career to mid-level Renewals Managers and Associates — rather than long-range strategic decision-making. The Manager, Renewals implements functional plans into tactical processes, makes routine operational decisions for their team, and relies primarily on their own experience to guide direct reports&#39; task execution and career growth. Their sphere of influence is largely limited to their direct reports and primary stakeholders, and they escalate cleanly to more senior leaders when decisions or progress are blocked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day work of a team of individual-contributor Renewals Managers/Associates, most of whom are at early-career to mid-level stages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement functional renewals plans and strategy into tactical, day-to-day processes for a book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate visibility into team renewals performance in the CRM/renewals system for forecasting and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver precise forecasting for their renewal segment alongside Field Sales Leadership and the Geo Director, incorporating projections for churn and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Customer Success, and Finance to keep renewals and expansion opportunities moving, escalating unusual or high-risk situations appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve renewal and team problems of moderate complexity by following GitLab&#39;s processes and policies and selecting the relevant solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate and coach business acumen — pricing, contract terms, whitespace, and expansion motion — to team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make routine operational decisions covering the team&#39;s day-to-day renewals operations, typically of lower complexity and risk, and escalate cleanly to appropriate levels when decisions or progress are blocked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide prioritization guidance to team members, helping them balance what is urgent and important to deliver quality key results and protect revenue and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and reinforce a clear renewal strategy for the team, ensuring alignment with broader Division and Company-wide priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish goals and tasks, set performance expectations, drive accountability, monitor progress, and ensure timely, relevant information is cascaded to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable the capacity and efficiency of team members by removing blockers and streamlining day-to-day renewals workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly communicate team objectives and how they reflect Division and Company-wide strategy and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and fill talent gaps on the team; care personally for team members and provide candid, real-time feedback and coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognize and proactively address engagement and retention needs, and foster an environment of open feedback and dialogue within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rely on your own experience to advise direct reports on career growth, with a focus on building task-level skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach team members on skills and behaviors aligned with GitLab&#39;s Operating Principles and high-performance culture, and weigh how prospective hires will amplify GitLab&#39;s values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly demonstrate, model, and coach GitLab&#39;s remote working best practices, including excellent remote presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience as a renewals, customer success, or sales professional, with exposure to renewal motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing or mentoring early-career to mid-level individual contributors, or clear readiness to step into first-line people management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of GitLab&#39;s (or a comparable SaaS company&#39;s) renewals processes, pricing, and contract fundamentals, with developing business acumen to coach others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate functional plans and strategy into clear, tactical day-to-day team processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment on routine operational decisions, with the discipline to escalate cleanly when issues exceed the team&#39;s scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prioritization skills and the ability to help others balance urgent versus important work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated people-leadership instincts: goal-setting, accountability, feedback, coaching, and fostering trust and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine care for team members&#39; growth, paired with candid, real-time feedback delivered productively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment with GitLab&#39;s Values and Operating Principles, and the ability to coach others toward a high-performance culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written, verbal, and remote presentation communication skills, with a bias toward action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a fully remote, asynchronous work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to travel for events such as trainings, team offsites, customer meetings, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are dedicated to driving customer retention and growth by managing the end-to-end renewal process for a large portfolio of customers. Our mission is to deliver a seamless, efficient, and positive renewal experience that supports long-term customer success. We leverage automation, data-driven insights, and close collaboration with Customer Success and Sales teams to proactively engage customers, identify risks and opportunities, and ensure timely renewals. We operate in a global, asynchronous environment, utilizing tools like Salesforce, Gainsight, and Gong to coordinate efforts and maintain high standards of customer satisfaction. Learn more about our approach and best practices in the&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/customer-success/renewals-managers/home/&quot;&gt; Renewals Manager Handbook&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab will support you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/paid-time-off/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/erg-guide/#:~:text=Definition%20of%20the%20TMRG%20%2D%20Team%20Member%20Resource%20Groups,-TMRGs%20are%20voluntary&amp;amp;text=The%20purpose%20for%20this%20type,developing%20the%20sense%20of%20belonging.&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Parental leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/finance/expenses/#equipment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Home office&lt;/a&gt; support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
